    {
      "id": "2e74653b-d0e4-51aa-b054-58a2ca6619ae",
      "name": "Note: intake",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Request in + normalize\nPOST `{ email, sku?, request_id? }` (JSON or text/plain JSON). An `Idempotency-Key` header also works.\n\nThe email is trimmed, lowercased and (optionally) Gmail-folded: dots and `+tags` removed, googlemail.com mapped to gmail.com. Turn it off with `FOLD_GMAIL_ALIASES = false`. Use the same rule wherever you write `purchases`.",
        "color": 5,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6ba510c1-7041-556d-8f5c-2b894717b177",
      "name": "Note: idempotency",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        500,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Idempotency\nEvery request has a `request_id`. If this id was already **delivered**, the gate replies with the same neutral message and stops. Nothing ships twice.\n\nA request that was **held** is checked again on retry, so it goes through once the order lands.",
        "color": 4,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bd16c88c-c039-5ab2-9078-58c3e1168e81",
      "name": "Note: verify",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1020,
        620
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Verify the entitlement\nLooks up `purchases` by the normalized email. Passes only when a row is in good standing (`paid`, `active`, `completed`, `fulfilled`) and matches the sku when one was sent. Refunded, disputed or cancelled orders never pass.\n\nThe product ships to the email **on the order**, not the one typed in the form.",
        "color": 6,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "257a1e47-d8f3-59ab-9dd6-929d87733270",
      "name": "Note: branches",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1500,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. Deliver or hold\n**Deliver:** replace the NoOp with an Execute Workflow node that calls your delivery workflow. Pass `deliver_to`, `skus`, `order_id`, `request_id`.\n\n**Hold for review:** writes the request and the internal reason to `held_requests`. The caller never gets the product.\n\nBoth paths log to `processed_requests` (the audit trail) and return the **same** 202 reply, so the endpoint can't be used to check who bought what.",
        "color": 3,
        "width": 560,
        "height": 320
      }
    }
